    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "Amidst the fierce online backlash in an unregulated digital space, advocates for orderly discourse mounted a defense of diverse casting to preserve order through inclusive stewardship. They argued this cultural perspective treats the Western canon as shared civilizational heritage, aiming to contain the reputational flashpoint and quell the ideological conflict. Their efforts represent a counter-argument to the baseless charges threatening legitimate creative authority and the project under scrutiny.",
