    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "The ongoing dispute, fueled by a casting announcement that turned a mythic epic into a social conflict, pits public figures making destabilizing accusations against the director asserting creative authority. This digital backlash has escalated into a public dispute over who may claim classical stories in mass-market film, forcing stewards working to contain the scandal with reasoned defense to address the allegations of erasing European history and restore stability to the cultural controversy.",
